`the case of the will of Rahim, made on 29 August 1938` MEANS `a plain case` `the WA Rahim` `married Gita in 1940, after the will` `the will of Rahim, made on 29 August 1938 in contemplation of his marriage to Gita`
`the case of a will charging the estate with a debt owed to a witness` MEANS `a plain case` `the WA Amrita` `no marriages` `the will of Amrita, charging the estate with a debt owed to a witness`
`the case of a legacy to one of two witnesses`    MEANS `a plain case` `the WA Amrita` `no marriages` `the will of Amrita, a legacy to one of her two witnesses`

