-- THE ONE CASE IN THIS FILE THAT IS WELL FORMED ACROSS THE s 27(3) JOIN
-- (CROSS-MODULE ROUND, X4). Farid's will in every particular, and the estate
-- also records Jaya as an infant concerned in it, with THE SAME `Guardian`
-- object the will appoints — `the guardian Farid appointed of his child Jaya`,
-- written once and read from both sides. Until this case existed, every
-- `Deceased person` in all four modules hardcoded `the infants concerned in the
